    "evidence_equivalence": "All commits after source_commit change only release evidence. Census tests run on the census-only follow-up; the native gates in qualification ran on the freeze commit. test:gpui-ax is waived (see ax_result).",
    "ax_result": "NOT RUN: effigy test:gpui-ax is waived for 0.5.0 by operator ruling (Tom, 2026-11-28). No AX pass is claimed for freeze commit 92cb0607c00b89f6d336ac465df3a248a6f19b5d. Reason: the console session was locked (IOConsoleLocked and CGSSessionScreenIsLocked true, observed 2026-11-28 05:48-05:49 UTC; display off since 00:45:57 UTC), and a plain AppKit control window with no Poodle or GPUI code, probed while locked, failed the same way: it reported its process name instead of its title. A locked run therefore gives no trustworthy evidence. The candidate worker's three attempts between 05:23 and 05:35 UTC on macOS 27.2.1 (two on the freeze commit, one on a v0.4.16 export) failed with the same symptom. They ran after the display went off but before the lock was observed, and are retained only as a record. Scope: the native crates have no external consumer at the v0.5.0 tag; Jetstream consumes GPUI only after poodle#211. Follow-up: the planner runs test:gpui-ax with the operator at the next milestone QA or with poodle#211. Retained logs: docs/evidence/releases/v0.5.0-qualification/test-gpui-ax.log (original sha256 59acbcf82ee33b20ca59ee9fa2749bad70662c9ef7583cc9f1a0fa4407276951, retained sha256 16133932821064188468b5aa065435a416bbc0f8215246ac5eda7ae3306ea2f4); docs/evidence/releases/v0.5.0-qualification/test-gpui-ax-v0.4.16-baseline.log (original sha256 5baee6ed167e4d90b277599ed77a35f199d76fe67ff089113818db243030abde, retained sha256 dcdea718743881c2bf8f04e4a9ab748db0b36f9116f60ae276494a2699b37eeb).",
    "web_certificate": "Run after the last evidence commit. The candidate PR records the exact certified head, result, archive hashes and identity-manifest digest; no certificate pass is asserted by this pre-certificate record.",
    "release_range": "payload_commits enumerates every commit in v0.4.16..base_commit. base_commit follows deriveWebCandidateBase (merge-base with origin/main), verified by release:web-certificate admission.",
    "log_retention": "Retained logs replace host-specific checkout, scratch, user, temp and Oxide roots, and other projects' build-slot names, with placeholders and drop trailing whitespace. log_sha256 identifies original bytes; retained_log_sha256 identifies portable retained bytes.",
    "toolchain": "Bun 1.4.2 from packageManager; release:bump coordinated all web/native manifests (including poodle-conformance and poodle-specimens), internal pins, locks and generated stamps without third-party lock refresh."
